      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just a ghost lately. like i go through the motions at the office, hitting all the targets, making the right calls, but i'm not even really there anymore. its just constant noise and pressure and i'm just... so incredibly tired. like it's in my bones. i look at my life and i dont even recognize the person who built it anymore.",
